							targetItem,
							levelUpDef,
						);
						selectSuggestedItem(targetItem);
						window.__evSetState(constructedState, targetItem);
						// Auto-open the calc panel and trigger the calculation
						if (typeof window.__evOpenCalcPanel === 'function') {
							window.__evOpenCalcPanel();
							setTimeout(() => {
								document.querySelector('.ev-start-btn')?.click();
								// Auto-scroll to results after calculation renders
								requestAnimationFrame(() => {
									requestAnimationFrame(() => {
										const rp = document.querySelector('[data-result-panel]');
										if (rp instanceof HTMLElement) {
											rp.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
										}
									});
								});
							}, 50);
						}
					} else {
						pendingDeconTransfer = { targetItem, strategy: transferPayload.strategy };
					}
				}
			}
		})
		.catch((error) => {
			console.error(error);
		});

	import { initEnhancementPanel } from '../lib/enhancementPanel.mjs';

	window.activatePanel2 = initEnhancementPanel(renderEnhancedItemCard);

	// Listen for enhancement data to finish loading so we can apply a
	// pending deconstruction→EV transfer that arrived before the data was ready.
	window.addEventListener('enhancementDataReady', () => {
		if (!pendingDeconTransfer) return;
		const { targetItem, strategy } = pendingDeconTransfer;
		pendingDeconTransfer = null;
		const levelUpById = window.__evGetItemLevelUpById?.();
		const levelUpDef = levelUpById?.get(targetItem.id) ?? null;
		const constructedState = buildEnhancementStateFromStrategy(
			strategy,
			targetItem,
			levelUpDef,
		);
		window.__evSetState(constructedState, targetItem);
		// Auto-open the calc panel and trigger the calculation
		if (typeof window.__evOpenCalcPanel === 'function') {
			window.__evOpenCalcPanel();
			setTimeout(() => {
				document.querySelector('.ev-start-btn')?.click();
				// Auto-scroll to results after calculation renders
				requestAnimationFrame(() => {
					requestAnimationFrame(() => {
						const rp = document.querySelector('[data-result-panel]');
						if (rp instanceof HTMLElement) {
							rp.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
						}
					});
				});
			}, 50);
		}
	});

	// ---- Expected Value Calculator wiring ----

	const resultPanel = document.querySelector('[data-result-panel]');
		const resultPlaceholder = resultPanel?.querySelector('[data-result-placeholder]');
		const resultContent = resultPanel?.querySelector('[data-result-content]');

		const calcPanel = document.querySelector('[data-calc-panel]');
		const calcPlaceholder = calcPanel?.querySelector('[data-calc-placeholder]');
		const calcContent = calcPanel?.querySelector('[data-calc-content]');

	let evResultUI = null;
	let evResultSummary = null;

	/** Update EV button enabled/disabled state based on current enhancement state. */
	const updateEvButtonState = () => {
          const calcStartBtn = document.querySelector('[data-ev-calc-start]');
          if (!calcStartBtn || !(calcStartBtn instanceof HTMLButtonElement)) return;

          // Button is enabled whenever there is an active enhancement state.
          // All strategies are now computed exactly, so there is no MC-only gate.
          const evState = window.__evState?.();
          calcStartBtn.disabled = !(evState && evState.enhancementState && evState.selectedBaseItem);
        };

window.__evRefresh = ({ showStale = true } = {}) => {
	  updateEvButtonState();
	  if (showStale && evResultSummary && evResultUI) {
	    evResultUI.showStale();
	  }
	  openCalcPanel();
	  checkStarState();
	};

	// Initial button state
	updateEvButtonState();

	/** Show the placeholder state (initial / after cancel). */
	const showEvPlaceholder = () => {
	  if (resultPlaceholder instanceof HTMLElement && resultContent instanceof HTMLElement) {
	    resultPlaceholder.hidden = false;
	    resultContent.hidden = true;
	    resultContent.replaceChildren();
	  }
	  evResultUI = null;
	  evResultSummary = null;
	  checkStarState();
	};
		// Exposed for enhancementPanel reset — fully clears EV results
		window.__evClear = showEvPlaceholder;

	/** Show a confirmation dialog overlay. Calls onConfirm if user confirms. */

	window.__evGuardEnhancementMutation = createResultMutationGuard({
	  hasResult: () => evResultUI !== null,
	  clearResult: showEvPlaceholder,
	  requestConfirmation: (onConfirm) => showEvConfirmationDialog(onConfirm, {
	    message: '계산 결과가 초기화됩니다. 계속하시겠습니까?',
	    confirmLabel: '계속',
	  }),
	});

	/** Render target selection UI into the calc panel. */
		const openCalcPanel = () => {
	  const evState = window.__evState?.();
	  if (!evState || !evState.enhancementState || !evState.selectedBaseItem) return;

	  const { selectedBaseItem, enhancementState } = evState;
	  const cleanStats = selectedBaseItem.stats ?? {};
	  const previewStats = computeAccumulatedStats(cleanStats, enhancementState);
	  const gains = computeEnhancementGains(cleanStats, previewStats);

	  // Create target selection UI (all positive-gain stats auto-derived as targets)
	  const targetUI = createTargetSelectionUI(gains);

	  // Render into calc panel
		  if (calcContent instanceof HTMLElement && calcPlaceholder instanceof HTMLElement) {
		    calcPlaceholder.hidden = true;
		    calcContent.hidden = false;
		    calcContent.replaceChildren();
		    calcContent.appendChild(targetUI.container);
		  }

		  // Update button state immediately
		  updateEvButtonState();

	  // Handle start: run calculation
	  targetUI.onStart(() => {
	    runEvCalculation(targetUI.getCheckedStats(), cleanStats, previewStats, enhancementState, selectedBaseItem);
	  });
	};

		// Exposed so enhancementPanel reset can re-render target selection
		window.__evOpenCalcPanel = openCalcPanel;

	/** Run the actual EV calculation and display results. */
	const runEvCalculation = (checkedStats, cleanStats, previewStats, enhancementState, selectedBaseItem) => {
	  // Build the scroll sequence from the user's enhancement state
	  const scrollSequence = enhancementState.scrollState.slots.filter(s => s !== null);
	  const makerChoices = enhancementState.gemSlots
	    .filter(s => s !== null)
	    .map(s => (s.stats
	      ? { gemKey: s.gemKey, stats: s.stats, mode: s.mode === MATERIAL_MODE_PROBABILITY ? MATERIAL_MODE_PROBABILITY : 'manual', grade: s.gradeIndex ?? 0 }
	      : { gemKey: s.gemKey, grade: s.gradeIndex }));

  const itemLevelUpMode = enhancementState.itemLevelUpMode ?? 'manual';

  const userStrategy = {
    makerChoices,
    scrollSequence,
    useItemLevelUp: itemLevelUpMode === MATERIAL_MODE_PROBABILITY,
    useStimulant: enhancementState.stimulantSlot?.mode === MATERIAL_MODE_PROBABILITY,
  };

  // Build stat filter from checked target stat checkboxes.
  // Only stats the user checked affect the probability; unchecked stats are ignored.
  const statFilter = new Set();
  if (checkedStats && typeof checkedStats === 'object') {
    for (const [key, checked] of Object.entries(checkedStats)) {
      if (key === 'grade') continue;
      if (checked) statFilter.add(key);
    }
  }

  // ---- Debug payload: structured snapshot of all calculation inputs ----
	  console.log('=== Expected-Value Debug Payload ===');
	  console.log(JSON.stringify({
	    _label: 'Expected-Value Debug Payload',
	    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
	    item: {
	      id: selectedBaseItem.id,
	      nameKo: selectedBaseItem.nameKo,
	      equipmentKind: selectedBaseItem.equipmentKind,
	      requiredLevel: selectedBaseItem.requiredLevel ?? 0,
	      requiredJobs: structuredClone(selectedBaseItem.requiredJobs ?? []),
	      cleanStats: structuredClone(cleanStats ?? {}),
	    },
	    previewStats: structuredClone(previewStats ?? {}),
	    targetConditions: {
      checkedStats,
      statFilter: [...statFilter],
    },
    enhancementState: {
      scrollSequence: scrollSequence.map(s => ({
        nameKo: s.nameKo,
        stats: structuredClone(s.stats ?? {}),
        behavior_type: s.behavior_type,
        success_rate: s.success_rate,
      })),
      makerChoices: structuredClone(makerChoices),
      stimulant: enhancementState.stimulantSlot ? {
        mode: enhancementState.stimulantSlot.mode,
        stats: structuredClone(enhancementState.stimulantSlot.stats ?? {}),
      } : null,
      itemLevelUp: {
        mode: itemLevelUpMode,
        slotCount: enhancementState.itemLevelUpSlots.filter(s => s !== null).length,
        slots: enhancementState.itemLevelUpSlots
          .filter(s => s !== null)
          .map(s => ({ stats: structuredClone(s.stats ?? {}) })),
      },
    },
    userStrategy,
    computationMode: canUseExactOutcome(userStrategy) ? 'exact-outcome' : 'threshold',
  }, null, 2));
		  console.log('=== End Debug Payload ===');

	  // Show result panel and hide its placeholder
	  if (resultPlaceholder instanceof HTMLElement && resultContent instanceof HTMLElement) {
	    resultPlaceholder.hidden = true;
	    resultContent.hidden = false;
	  }

	  // Create or reuse result UI
	  if (!evResultUI) {
	    evResultUI = createResultUI();
	    if (resultContent instanceof HTMLElement) {
	      resultContent.replaceChildren();
	      resultContent.appendChild(evResultUI.container);
	    }
	  }

	  const hasEnhancements = scrollSequence.length > 0 || makerChoices.length > 0
	    || enhancementState.stimulantSlot !== null
	    || enhancementState.itemLevelUpSlots.some(s => s !== null);

	  let probability;
  try {
    if (!hasEnhancements) {
      probability = 1.0;
    } else if (canUseExactOutcome(userStrategy)) {
      // Exact-outcome mode: probability that every scroll produces
      // EXACTLY its user-specified stats. Direct multiplication — no DP.
      probability = computeDirectOutcomeProbability(scrollSequence, { statFilter });
    } else {
      probability = 0; // DP engine removed
    }
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('Expected-value computation failed:', err);
    evResultUI.showZeroSuccess();
    evResultSummary = null;
    return;
  }

          if (probability <= 0) {
            evResultUI.showZeroSuccess();
            evResultSummary = null;
          } else {
            const resultSummary = createResultSummary({
              successProbability: probability,
              bestStrategy: userStrategy,
		    computationMode: canUseExactOutcome(userStrategy) ? 'exact-outcome' : 'threshold',
            });
            evResultUI.update(resultSummary);
            evResultSummary = resultSummary;
          }
		};
		// Calculation is triggered from the 계산 시작 button inside the calc panel.
		// The button is rendered by createTargetSelectionUI and wired via onStart in openCalcPanel.

	// ---- Save slot helpers (EV-specific) ----



	const loadEvSlot = (slotIndex) => {
	  const slots = readSlots('expectedValue');
	  const s = slots[slotIndex];
	  if (!s?.pageState?.enhancementState) return;

	  const item = itemById.get(s.pageState.itemId);
	  if (!item) {
	    alert('저장된 아이템을 더 이상 찾을 수 없습니다.');
	    return;
	  }

	  // Guard: confirm before overwriting a generated result, same as Panel 2.
	  const applyLoad = () => {
	    if (typeof window.__evSetState === 'function') {
	      window.__evSetState(s.pageState.enhancementState, item);
	    } else if (typeof window.activatePanel2 === 'function') {
	      // Fallback: re-activate panel with the saved item
	      window.activatePanel2(item);
	    }
	    renderEvSlots();
	    checkStarState();
	  };

	  if (typeof window.__evGuardEnhancementMutation === 'function') {
	    window.__evGuardEnhancementMutation(applyLoad);
	  } else {
	    applyLoad();
	  }
	};

	// ---- Wrappers for extracted slot bar functions ----
	const refreshEvSlots = () => { renderEvSlots(); checkStarState(); };
	const renderEvSlots = () => renderEvSlotBar({ evSlotBar, readSlots, MAX_SLOTS, buildItemIconUrl, onLoadSlot: loadEvSlot, onDeleteSlot: (i) => confirmDeleteEvSlot({ slotIndex: i, readSlots, clearSlot, buildItemIconUrl, onSlotChanged: refreshEvSlots }) });
	const checkStarState = () => checkEvStarState({ evStar, buildPageState: buildEvPageState, findMatchingSlot });

	renderEvSlots();


	// ---- State setter for loading saved slots ----
	window.__evSetState = (storedEnhancementState, storedItem) => {
	  // Restore the saved enhancement state (scrolls, gems, stimulant, level-ups)
	  if (typeof window.__restoreEvState === 'function') {
	    window.__restoreEvState(storedEnhancementState, storedItem);
